@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Plervo TLS dependency patch
+
+Source: RustCrypto/rustls-rustcrypto, crates.io package 0.0.2-alpha. Original MIT/Apache notices are preserved.
+
+The Cargo dependency on rustls-webpki changes from 0.102.0 to 0.103.13 or newer, incorporating the fixes for RUSTSEC-2026-0104, 0098, 0099 and 0049. The three verification modules import the unchanged ASN.1 algorithm identifiers from rustls::pki_types::alg_id, their new upstream location. No cryptographic algorithm implementation is modified. Cargo.lock pins the resulting package checksums.
+
+The application uses this provider only as an HTTPS client without client authentication. It never loads an RSA private key; the RSA public-key verification dependency still has the general RUSTSEC-2023-0071 advisory, which must remain documented rather than described as patched.
